@startuml sequence-checkout
title BrewLite – Sequence: Đặt đơn & Thanh toán (Checkout)
autonumber

actor "Customer" as C
participant "Next.js UI" as UI
participant "NestJS API" as API
database "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Payment Service" as PAY

== Phase 1: Đặt đơn (FR-05, NFR05) ==

C -> UI : Tap "Tiến hành đặt đơn"\n(cart, receiveType)
UI -> API : POST /orders\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\nbody: {items[], receiveType}

API -> API : Verify JWT signature & expiry
API -> API : Check role = CUSTOMER
API -> API : Validate DTO\n(cart not empty, receiveType valid)

alt JWT missing/invalid
  API --> UI : 401 Unauthorized
  UI --> C : Redirect to login\n(cart kept)
else JWT valid and input valid
  API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
  API -> DB : SELECT stock FROM products\nWHERE id IN (...) FOR UPDATE
  DB --> API : current stock values

  alt stock < requested quantity
    API -> DB : ROLLBACK
    API --> UI : 409 Conflict (out of stock)
    UI --> C : Show error, reject order
  else stock sufficient
    API -> DB : INSERT order\n(status = PENDING, expiresAt = now + 15 min)
    API -> DB : INSERT order_items (name, unitPrice snapshot, options)
    API -> DB : UPDATE products SET stock = stock - qty
    API -> DB : COMMIT
    DB --> API : orderId, totalAmount
    API --> UI : 201 Created {orderId, totalAmount}
    UI --> C : Show order and amount to pay
  end
end

== Phase 2: Thanh toán (FR-06, NFR05) ==

C -> UI : Chọn Ví / Thẻ và bấm Thanh toán
UI -> API : POST /orders/{orderId}/payments\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\nIdempotency-Key: <uuid>\nbody: {method}

API -> API : Verify JWT and order owner = current user
API -> DB : SELECT payment WHERE idempotencyKey = <key>
DB --> API : result (found or not found)

alt Duplicate request (same Idempotency-Key)
  API --> UI : 200 OK (stored result,\nno new charge)
else New request
  API -> DB : INSERT payment\n(status = PENDING, idempotencyKey)
  API -> PAY : charge(amount, method, idempotencyKey)
  PAY --> API : result + gatewayRef

  alt Payment SUCCESS
    API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API -> DB : UPDATE payment SET status = SUCCESS
    API -> DB : UPDATE orders SET status = PAID
    API -> DB : COMMIT
    API --> UI : 200 OK {status: PAID}
    UI --> C : Show "Đặt hàng thành công"\n(order tracking)
  else Payment FAILED
    API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API -> DB : UPDATE payment SET status = FAILED
    API -> DB : UPDATE orders SET status = PAYMENT_FAILED
    API -> DB : COMMIT
    API --> UI : 402 Payment Required {status: PAYMENT_FAILED}
    UI --> C : Show "Thanh toán thất bại"\n[Retry] button (cart kept)
  end
end

== Phase 3: Hết hạn (FR-07) ==

note over API, DB
  A scheduled job (not triggered by the customer) runs
  periodically: any order in PENDING or PAYMENT_FAILED
  with expiresAt < now() moves to CANCELLED, and
  stock is returned in the same transaction.
end note

@enduml
